# The build context is the repository root. Only the workspace's crates go in: not
# `.cargo/config.toml`, which pins `target-cpu=native`, and not local weights or build output.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!ptts
!ptts-coreml
!ptts-coreml-ffi
!ptts-openai-server
!ptts-pyo3
!ptts-wasm
!ptts-ws-server
**/target
**/*.safetensors
**/*.gguf
**/*.wav
ptts-pyo3/python
ptts-pyo3/tests
ptts-wasm/js
ptts-wasm/pkg
ptts-wasm/site
ptts-wasm/www
